      "default": "<p>At what age can my pup start using these? </p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "replo_text_582a5072-caa0-4778-8884-cff66c309de2",
      "type": "richtext",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>The Multivitamin is suitable for dogs of all ages and breeds. However, we do recommend dogs begin to incorporate the chews into their daily routine starting at an age of 3 months or older.</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "replo_text_7f30403c-7adb-4443-8184-152aff6de48b",
      "type": "richtext",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>What does 100% Human-Grade mean? </p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "replo_text_b083fe2c-eaec-491d-a308-ec483df93e5f",
      "type": "richtext",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>Most pet supplements from other brands contain palm oil, fillers, artificial flavoring, preservatives, etc. At VitalPaws, we’re raising the standards of pet health by only using the highest quality human-grade ingredients, which is what our best friends deserve.</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "replo_text_16213426-0851-44ac-9142-acccf6e32302",
      "type": "richtext",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>How long until I start seeing the benefits?</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "replo_text_831a5ddc-68eb-4cb1-a6f4-44e9e54870b7",
      "type": "richtext",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>The benefits that most dogs feel—less itching, more activity, better mood—are just bonuses to improving their long-term health. If taken consistently on a daily basis, most dogs will start to see positive effects in about 6-8 weeks.</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "replo_text_07b37361-3561-4831-a5d9-d6a551950c59",
      "type": "richtext",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>How many chews come in a jar? </p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "replo_text_8a45a934-2180-451b-9c44-d71003024266",
      "type": "richtext",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>What flavour is the Multivitamin?</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "replo_text_f6dc1711-e368-4aaf-8c58-2b6be8f0f84d",
      "type": "richtext",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>Our Multivitamin is made with the highest quality human-grade duck meat, a flavour that dogs absolutely love. In the case of a chicken allergy, we recommend our Beef flavour!</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "replo_text_175fa1eb-966c-4d52-9627-0a40efea048c",
      "type": "richtext",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>What happens if I accidentally give my dog too many chews? </p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "replo_text_2e7ff099-7951-4923-8d21-d680b551aa79",
      "type": "richtext",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>In the event that your dog accidentally consumes significantly more than the daily recommended dose, consult your vet for advice.</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "replo_text_5f92cd34-5fe8-42be-9886-89b0f86ac8a3",
      "type": "richtext",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>Can I take this dog multivitamin with other supplements? </p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "replo_text_571a30df-4b56-4ef8-b906-dce0d31b071f",
      "type": "richtext",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>Our veterinary team formulated our Daily Vitamin with natural ingredients that can be taken both alone or as a complementary product with other common and more targeted pet supplements. Nevertheless, we still recommend checking with your vet.</p>"
    }
  ]
